        "stage": 43,
        "statement": "Water is several inches deep in the Walmart and CVS parking lots and other business in the region. Water surrounds the Balnco River Lodge apartments. Water into many homes and businesses along the river between I-35, SH 80 and River road. Water over teh Hwy 80 bridge at San Marcos "
