        "stage": 24,
        "statement": "Lowest homes are threatened. Water beings to cut off secondary roads near the river "
      },
      {
        "stage": 18,
        "statement": "Roadways and low bridges along the river are flooded. Vehicles cannot pass. Livestock can be stranded. "
      },
      {
